{"src":"en","tgt":"id","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"id","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7721.345653,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":8786.309779,"text":"Jika Anda sudah menonton film National Treasure, Anda mungkin berpikir sebuah peta harta karun tertulis di bagian belakang Deklarasi Kemerdekaan."},{"kind":"audio","t":8981.542984,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8985.904142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8991.059877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":8996.285211999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":9001.641904,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9006.970946,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9012.120092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9012.505925,"samples":3566,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":13885.898626,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":14693.238170999999,"text":"Cokelat panas ini memenuhi standar Belgia. Jus buah harganya mahal, tetapi lama-kelamaan, Anda akan bisa merasakan manisnya."},{"kind":"audio","t":14790.308196999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14794.975841,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14795.64576,"samples":8582,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":14812.613690999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14817.356993000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14822.773374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14828.316792999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14828.821535,"samples":6575,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":22222.99485,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":23067.088732,"text":"Namun, hal itu tidak benar. Meskipun ada sesuatu yang tertulis di bagian belakang dokumen tersebut, itu bukan peta harta karun."},{"kind":"audio","t":23137.454047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23138.597818,"samples":14321,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"audio","t":23189.124298,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23190.184301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23191.732696,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23193.247731,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23193.89418,"samples":20229,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":840},{"kind":"input","t":29982.044755,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":31006.462506,"text":"Anda mungkin juga ingin berkonsultasi dengan saran dari pemerintah selain pemerintah Anda sendiri, tetapi saran mereka dirancang untuk warga negara mereka."},{"kind":"audio","t":31179.391077,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31184.401735,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31189.695578,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31194.830143,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31200.093487,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31205.316481,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31210.105593,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":31210.595694999996,"samples":10253,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":41297.159727,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42154.917014,"text":"Pulau Hong Kong memberikan nama bagi wilayah Hong Kong dan merupakan tempat yang dianggap oleh banyak wisatawan sebagai fokus utama."},{"kind":"audio","t":42298.192982,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42302.816006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42308.162899,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42313.195646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42318.380920999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42323.466227,"samples":31764,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"input","t":49439.551038,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":50693.124307,"text":"Siapa pun yang akan berkendara di lintang panas atau melewati jalur pegunungan harus mempertimbangkan kemungkinan adanya salju, es, atau pembekuan"},{"kind":"audio","t":50850.13628,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50854.941621,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50860.144745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50865.34427,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50870.637343,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50875.912297,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50879.152043,"samples":22402,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":930},{"kind":"input","t":58793.38583,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":59680.85769,"text":"Segregasi dan rekombinasi mengocok variasi bolak-balik di antara kedua kumpulan tersebut."},{"kind":"audio","t":59789.397448,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59790.767715,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59792.017155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59793.52217,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59794.16178,"samples":18000,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":61184.211888,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61402.820609,"text":"pada setiap generasi."},{"kind":"audio","t":61443.292445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61443.762627,"samples":6798,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":66512.227555,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67180.602832,"text":"Istilah bug digunakan oleh ahli entomologi dalam arti formal untuk kelompok serangga ini."},{"kind":"audio","t":67286.237987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67287.329429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67288.618638,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67290.211052,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67290.727764,"samples":13263,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":74700.138918,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":75655.208277,"text":"Pertama, sebagian besar pengendara mengenakan sepatu bot berkuda dengan tumit dan sol yang halus serta cukup sempit."},{"kind":"audio","t":75783.577109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75788.424016,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75793.640437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75798.778569,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75804.236176,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75805.047153,"samples":9195,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":83918.942319,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":84770.632818,"text":"Komisi tersebut merupakan tanggapan Martelli terhadap protes anti-rezim luas yang dimulai pada bulan Oktober."},{"kind":"audio","t":84898.054416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84902.908153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84908.089135,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84913.09248,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84918.232232,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84919.029878,"samples":8916,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":91142.046182,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":91884.273808,"text":"Petugas pemadam kebakaran akhirnya memadamkan api pada pukul 23.35."},{"kind":"audio","t":91999.841008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92004.793623,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92009.960885,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92015.056708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92018.238764,"samples":21900,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"input","t":97372.222624,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98114.578297,"text":"Badai yang menegangkan dari musim badai Atlantik, Badai Subtropis Jerry,"},{"kind":"audio","t":98207.07267,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98212.118934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98217.175908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98218.487166,"samples":12037,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":100228.046315,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100726.849751,"text":"terbentuk di Samudra Atlantik hari ini."},{"kind":"audio","t":100779.877457,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100781.057367,"samples":29647,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"input","t":107241.128259,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":107879.493755,"text":"Hal ini telah membawa kita untuk melatih mobil dan banyak perangkat transportasi lainnya."},{"kind":"audio","t":107982.737625,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107987.844008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107993.02515,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":107998.395378,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107998.685063,"samples":2674,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":116620.062397,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117470.922571,"text":"Tempat ini terkenal sebagai pusat kemewahan yang dimulai sekitar tahun 400 M dan berlangsung hingga u"},{"kind":"audio","t":117596.47419,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117601.243539,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117606.48791,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117611.76927,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117616.831023,"samples":31931,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"input","t":120745.912376,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121206.08468,"text":"sampai sekitar tahun 1100 M."},{"kind":"audio","t":121267.175178,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121272.131424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121272.433639,"samples":3566,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":127070.127154,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127579.633967,"text":"Permukaan bulan terbuat dari batuan dan debu. Lapisan luar bulan disebut kerak."},{"kind":"audio","t":127648.253988,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127653.200563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127653.757674,"samples":8582,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"audio","t":127659.704802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127662.79112,"samples":20452,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"input","t":134215.93814500002,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135132.057146,"text":"Korps Zeni AS memperkirakan bahwa curah hujan setinggi enam inci dapat menjebol bagian yang sebelumnya rusak"},{"kind":"audio","t":135268.74522600003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135273.538734,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135278.88615300003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135283.97893600003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135289.32206500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135289.68786900002,"samples":4458,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":141452.43599000003,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":142583.67346400002,"text":"Secara khusus, diklaim bahwa seseorang dapat mendeteksi apakah seseorang sedang berbohong dengan menginterpretasikan mikroekspresi secara benar."},{"kind":"audio","t":142739.625655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":142744.275205,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142749.50245600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142754.767556,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142759.949358,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142765.38487500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142767.80917400002,"samples":23517,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"input","t":147241.347375,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":147814.628081,"text":"Jangan merusak situs dengan membuat coretan atau grafiti pada struktur."},{"kind":"audio","t":147904.363071,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147909.14303900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147914.3653,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147915.99025300003,"samples":13430,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":154876.824637,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":156071.61135700002,"text":"Raungan harimau tidak seperti raungan singa yang lantang, melainkan lebih seperti rangkaian kata-kata yang menggeram dan diteriakkan."},{"kind":"audio","t":156212.748981,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156217.69014700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156222.614013,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156227.90245300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156233.070175,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156238.23848700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":156238.387044,"samples":111,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":161914.73051800003,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":163080.38771500002,"text":"Penelitian abad ke-20 telah menunjukkan bahwa terdapat dua kumpulan variasi genetik, yang tersembunyi dan yang terekspresikan."},{"kind":"audio","t":163223.680962,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163228.41528100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163233.56015300003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163238.891242,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":163244.20337200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163249.46799200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163249.754217,"samples":1504,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"close","t":173305.388149,"code":1005}]}